# Silicon PBE model shared by the SCF, Wannier and band-path calculations.
lattice face-centered Cubic 10.26
coords-type lattice
ion-species SG15/$ID_ONCV_PBE.upf
ion Si 0 0 0 1
ion Si 0.25 0.25 0.25 1
spintype no-spin
elec-ex-corr gga-PBE
elec-cutoff 30
elec-n-bands 60
converge-empty-states yes
electronic-minimize nIterations 300 energyDiffThreshold 1e-12
